      "message": "Could it be a rounding error because of the changed coded_size (https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:media/filters/vpx_video_decoder.cc;l\u003d552;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1)? Chromium uses vpx_image-\u003ew which is set to y_stride by libvpx, and the ratio between visible_size and coded_size would change due to increased border size esp. for small videos.",
